{
    "quest": {
        "id": "74510",
        "title": "A Not-So-Distant Farewell",
        "description": "\"Lil' Fungi's Fun-Tastic Fiesta\"'s debut ends here. Haniyyah and Souka will keep improving the game, and make preparations for an official tournament in the future. That said, they won't be going off to some distant place this time...",
